WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,250 --> 00:00:08,450
There is not one inside

2
00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:11,260
Don't worry, I'll listen to the number of people

3
00:00:12,590 --> 00:00:27,830
One, two, three, ten, eleven, twelve. Check it out.

4
00:00:29,670 --> 00:00:31,500
How many are under the door?

5
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:36,730
There are at least a dozen fully formed plow ghosts.

6
00:00:36,930 --> 00:00:40,220
Twelve desperate plow ghosts

7
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:51,340
Plus two that are already half corpses
